  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/stoneborn_text.png?raw=true\" /> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"> STONEBORN 是一款簡潔獨特的介面改裝，靈感來自奇幻媒體。視覺舒適、裝飾輕盈且風格統一，適合任何遊玩體驗，無論是原版還是整合包。</span> </span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em> 外面危機四伏，讓 STONEBORN 伴你踏上下一段冒險吧！</em> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">探索其他 STONEBORN 套件：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\"><br /> </a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-gear\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFgear.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-odds-ends\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFOaE.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a></span></p>\n<p><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: #ff0000; text-decoration: underline;\">【重新上傳與相容性相關重要條款】</span></span></strong></em></span></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">請<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不要</span>重新上傳套件檔案，無論是在 Modrinth、Planet Minecraft、CurseForge 或其他任何託管或論壇頁面。若需向他人推薦或連結此套件，請導向本 CurseForge 頁面。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">請<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不要</span>聲稱擁有此套件或將它宣稱為自己的作品。若需在其他地方推薦或連結此套件，請務必給予我（Sindavar）適當的署名。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以為與其他模組 UI 相容而建立或編輯套件中的資源檔。然而，這些資源包僅能包含其所替換模組的內建資源，不得包含基礎 <br />STONEBORN 材質包。（您的模組相容支援包應作為 STONEBORN 的載入層）</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以自由託管這些套件，但請將 <br />STONEBORN 頁面列為相依項目並附上所有適當的署名。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您不得將 STONEBORN 與其他資源包打包後，在 Modrinth 或其他任何平台重新上傳。我理解這對伺服器等平台可能帶來方便，但這會影響本頁面的收益與下載量。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以為了<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">個人使用</span>而編輯或建立 STONEBORN 的資源檔，但這些修改過的檔案不得以任何形式重新上傳。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">如果您對上述任何條款不確定，或對重新上傳、編輯套件有任何疑問，歡迎與我聯繫。 </span><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">如果您發現任何違規重新上傳、未適當署名或違反上述條款的情況，也請告知我。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">開發者備註：</span></strong></em></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">我不斷尋求改進作品，因此非常歡迎針對套件的建議。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">使用非英文語言可能會導致部分文字元素無法顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">本套件預計（希望如此）將在 1.17 之後的未來 <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">Minecraft</span> 版本中持續維護。本套件將不再支援更舊的版本。<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">歡迎在下方留言區回報您遇到的任何問題，非常感謝您的關注 :)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">有問題嗎？請在 Discord 上私訊我，或在 Discord 伺服器中提問！<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-size: 14px;\">- Sindavar</span><br /></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /> </span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">在其他平台支持我 & 加入 Discord！:</span></em></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Sindavar33\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/twitter.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sindavart/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/ig.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/sindavar/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/pmc.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/sindavar\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/heart.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MF2z3KZp8Z\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> </span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/stoneborn\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e367a0c4-0cf1-4832-bf34-643c5b8f0742.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\" /> </a></span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>",
